* PMOS ON - subcircuit version of pmos_on_ngspice.cir, for use inside gate netlists (Part B / Part C)
* Same device as the dataset netlist:  M1 d g s b pmos L=22n W=...   (terminals d g s b, width as a parameter)
* The ON state comes from the gate voltage applied by the gate netlist; the device itself is the same as in pmos_on_ngspice.cir.
.include 22nm_HP.pm
.subckt pmos_on d g s b w=44n
M1 d g s b pmos L=22n W={w}
.ends pmos_on
